OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening to come. Cloud increasing
OL,7,Fovernight from the north, with the odd
OL,8,Fspot of rain in places by dawn, but
OL,9,Fstaying dry for most and mild.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA cloudy start to the day
OL,12,Fwith any rain soon clearing during the
OL,13,Fmorning. Drier and brighter for the
OL,14,Fafternoon, with spells of sunshine for
OL,15,Fmany. Feeling pleasant.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,18,Fspells and showers expected throughout
OL,19,Fthis period. Some of the showers will
OL,20,Fbe heavy and times, with the risk of
OL,21,Fhail and thunder. A fresh feel for all.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
